  {
    "@id": "https://www.gabriolatheatrecentre.ca/event-details-registration/wooler",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Wooler | Gabriola Theatre Cen"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Formed in 2019, Wooler was originally a studio recording project lead by composer/band leader Alias Powell, motivated by idea of being free from artistic constraints such as genre, musical trends, image, desire to be popular, or technical limitations. The result was a dense soundscape bouncing around many genres, with noise/feedback, horns, improvised drums, guitar solos, some spoken word, and unorthodox melodies. After bringing in a wide variety of musicians to play on Wooler&#39;s first record Without Your Mind, a band was eventually formed to bring Wooler&#39;s music to the stage. The band&#39;s first live appearance was in early 2020, but no momentum was gained as the pandemic forced the group into dormancy. Wooler has since clawed its way back on stage, is completing a second studio album set for release in April 2024, released an artistic music video, and has released two live video recordings in early 2024. Wooler has become a band that truly sounds like nothing else, and never backs away from the contrast that makes music exciting. Love it or hate, this band is guaranteed not to be boring.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5d671_d525d181ea934e27ba0a2f038157b9a8~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1585,h_2450,al_c,q_90/c5d671_d525d181ea934e27ba0a2f038157b9a8~mv2.jpg"
      }
    ],
