        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Santa is Coming to Gabriola | Gabriola Theatre Cen"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Santa is Coming to Gabriola\n1-2pm For Children of All Ages\nPhotos with Santa by Bill Pope\nCookies and Storytime\n\n4pm Community Celebration\nDramatic Reading of\n\" A Child's Christmas in Wales\" and Carol Singing\n\nAll Proceeds to Charity\n\nRSVP with numbers of children, for our cookie count"
      }
