    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Allannah Dow, on cello and vocals and carol weaver, on guitar, frame drum + vocals:\nWhen this duo play and sing together they magically weave earth and sky to create a hallowed space, beautifully engaging their audience to co-create a sanctuary filled with music, singing and song."
