    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "HOT FLASH COMEDY with your host SYD BOSEL, headlining CATHY BOYD and special guests BOBBIE WILLIAMS & Gabriola's own SCARLETT CHEN\n\nFun for everyone (over 18). Bring your friends and your panty-liners!!"
