    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A special trio of steel/slide guitarist who have been playing together for years. Each musician has a strong connection to Gabriola, Bob Blair is a part-time resident, Sue Decker has played here several times and Chris Bauer spent his childhood summers at his family cabin on Gabe! Doors 6:30pm"
